# Dawn (CoP 8-4): each handler at a state it does not answer (GMs set the vars). Empyreal Paradox's zone-in at
# Status 1 and 4: nothing; TR_Entrance at Status 4: the battlefield entry refuses (a lone release). Option 31 (all
# five bits): Mhaura's zone-in at Status 3: its own (an empty cutscene table), no 322; Status 4 with Timer 1 (no
# expiry): the same; bob (The Last Verse current, Status 4, Option 31) logging in to Mhaura: the same. Status 4,
# Timer 0: Option 27 (bit 2 clear): Mhaura's own empty table, no 322; Option 23 (bit 3 clear): Oldton Movalpolos'
# zone-in nothing;
# Option 15 (bit 4 clear): Cid's default 500. Option 30 (bit 0 clear): Hinaree's default 507 (the zones'
# DefaultActions; Southern San d'Oria's zone-in
# plays Rhapsodies' 30035); Option 31, LProg 1: Hinaree 507, area 1 nothing; LProg 0 and 2: Uleguerand Range's
# zone-in nothing. Option 0: Ru'Lude Gardens' area 1 at Status 3: nothing; Status 4 with Timer 1: 122 (this area
# does not look at the Timer), finished: Status 5. Status 4: _6s1's own 124 (0, 1). Status 5: _0qa's
# DOOR_IS_LOCKED_TIGHT (11040, the zone's default). Status 6: Lufaise Meadows' area 1 nothing.
lists EmpyrealParadox/onZoneIn/1 EmpyrealParadox/TR_Entrance/onTrigger Mhaura/onZoneIn/1 OldtonMovalpolos/onZoneIn/1 Metalworks/Cid/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/Hinaree/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/onTriggerAreaEnter/1 UleguerandRange/onZoneIn/1 RuludeGardens/onTriggerAreaEnter/1 UpperJeuno/_6s1/onTrigger TavnazianSafehold/_0qa/onTrigger LufaiseMeadows/onTriggerAreaEnter/1
char zone=EmpyrealParadox pos=541.5,-1.2,-597.7 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Cop Dawn current
charvar Mission[6][840]Status 1
char bob zone=Mhaura pos=0.003,-6.252,117.971 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
bob: mission Cop TheLastVerse current
bob: charvar Mission[6][840]Status 4
bob: charvar Mission[6][840]Option 31
login
warp 541.5,-1.2,-597.7 EmpyrealParadox
charvar Mission[6][840]Status 4
warp 541.5,-1.2,-597.7 EmpyrealParadox
trigger TR_Entrance
finish-if-event
charvar Mission[6][840]Option 31
charvar Mission[6][840]Status 3
warp 0.003,-6.252,117.971 Mhaura
charvar Mission[6][840]Status 4
charvar Mission[6][840]Timer 1
warp 0.003,-6.252,117.971 Mhaura
charvar Mission[6][840]Timer 0
bob: login
charvar Mission[6][840]Option 27
warp 0.003,-6.252,117.971 Mhaura
